(Lumen Robotics Employee Handbook) Tj T*
(Version 3.1, effective 1 January 2026. Fictional sample document.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Welcome) Tj T*
(This handbook explains the main policies for employees of Lumen Robotics.) Tj T*
(If a policy here differs from your employment contract, your contract applies.) Tj T*
(Questions about this handbook go to the People team at people@lumen.example.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Working hours) Tj T*
(The standard working week is 38 hours, Monday to Friday. Core hours are) Tj T*
(10:00 to 15:00, when everyone should be available for meetings. Outside core) Tj T*
(hours you can choose when to work, as long as you agree it with your manager.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Remote work) Tj T*
(Employees can work remotely for up to three days per week. Engineers who work) Tj T*
(with robot hardware must be on site at least two days per week, because the) Tj T*
(test lab cannot be used remotely. Fully remote arrangements need approval) Tj T*
(from both your manager and the People team.) Tj T*
(Lumen pays a home-office allowance of 600 USD once every two years, for a) Tj T*
(desk, chair or monitor. Keep the receipts and submit them as an expense.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
