(7. Expenses and travel) Tj T*
(Expenses must be submitted within 60 days, with a receipt for every item over) Tj T*
(25 USD. Book travel through the company travel portal. Economy class is the) Tj T*
(standard for flights under 6 hours; premium economy is allowed for longer) Tj T*
(flights. The daily meal allowance during business travel is 75 USD.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Safety in the test lab) Tj T*
(Everyone entering the robot test lab must complete safety training first and) Tj T*
(wear safety glasses. Never enter the marked safety zone of an LR-200 arm while) Tj T*
(it is powered. If a robot behaves unexpectedly, press the emergency stop and) Tj T*
(report the incident to the lab lead within 24 hours, even if nobody was hurt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Learning budget) Tj T*
(Each employee has a learning budget of 1,500 USD per year for courses,) Tj T*
(conferences and books. Unused budget does not carry over.) Tj T*
ET
